# Clause 7: Support

## Overview
Clause 7 addresses the support resources, competence, awareness, communication, and documentation needed for a functioning ISMS.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-006 | Resources | HIGH | Partially Implemented |
| GAP-007 | Competence | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-008 | Awareness | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-009 | Communication | MEDIUM | Not Implemented |
| GAP-010 | Documented Information | HIGH | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Allocate appropriate resources (people, budget, infrastructure)
- Ensure staff competence through training
- Build awareness of policies and responsibilities
- Establish communication channels
- Maintain comprehensive ISMS documentation

## Remediation Priority

**CRITICAL** — This clause has 5 gaps affecting 4 areas. Without people, competence, awareness, and documentation, ISMS implementation will fail.
